              "variable": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "type": "any",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "key": "resource_type",
                  "description": "(Required) Type of data source resource."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "type": "any",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "key": "resource_id",
                  "description": "(Required) ID of data source resource. The ID to be specified depends on the value of `resource_type`.\n\n| `resource_type` | The ID you specify |\n|-|-|\n| `Subscriber` | IMSI of the IoT SIM |\n| `LoraDevice` | ID of the LoRaWAN device |\n| `Sim` | SIM ID of the IoT SIM |\n| `SigfoxDevice` | ID of the Sigfox device |\n| `Device` | ID of the Inventory device |\n| `SoraCam` | Device ID of the compatible camera device |\n"
